{
  "title": "Zesty Smoky Croatian Meat Stew",
  "description": "A smoky and velvety Croatian stew featuring yellow curry paste and kombu cold extract, perfect for a crowd, and low in carbs. This hearty dish is sure to please.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
    "low-carb",
